                            </sup>
                        </i><i>
                            <sup>
                                <span lang=RU style='font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>)</span>
                            </sup>
                        </i><span lang=RU style='font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>
                            размера
                        </span><i>
                            <span lang=EN style='font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;
font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>s</span>
                        </i><span lang=RU
                                  style='font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>
